<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine bankers association meeting on peso.</title>
<headline>Philippine bankers association meeting on peso.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bankers Association of the Philippines said it was meeting at noon (0400 GMT) to consider the situation after the peso was effectively devalued.</p>
<p>The meeting will be presided by Philippine National Bank (PNB) president Peter Favila at the PNB headquarters, the BAP said.</p>
<p>The BAP did not state the specific matters to be taken up.</p>
<p>It said the decision to suspend peso-dollar trades for the rest of the day implied that there will be no fixing for today.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a special situation and concerned parties are requested to address their respective situations accordingly,&quot; BAP official Asterio Favis said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
